{"id":47772,"date":"2026-01-06T21:38:17","date_gmt":"2026-01-06T20:38:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-dos-morcegos\/"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:32:00","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:32:00","slug":"trail-dos-morcegos","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-dos-morcegos\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail dos Morcegos 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail dos Morcegos 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>X Edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail dos Morcegos 2026 (TdM)<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>19 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Ponta Delgada<\/strong>, na deslumbrante <strong>Ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel (A\u00e7ores)<\/strong>. Organizado pelo <strong>Morcegos Trail Clube<\/strong> com o apoio da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Ponta Delgada<\/strong> e das Juntas de Freguesia da Relva, Candel\u00e1ria, Covoada e Feteiras, o evento \u00e9 uma refer\u00eancia nos trilhos do arquip\u00e9lago, pontuando para o <strong>Circuito Nacional ATRP (S\u00e9rie 150)<\/strong>, <strong>ITRA<\/strong>, <strong>UTMB Index<\/strong> e para o <strong>Circuito de Trail da Ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel (CTSMI)<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com meta unificada no <strong>Centro Social e Paroquial Nossa Senhora das Neves (Relva)<\/strong>, o programa \u00e9 composto pelo majestoso <strong>Ultra Trail de 52 km (+2.210m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>07:30<\/strong> (partida no Palheiro da Candel\u00e1ria), o <strong>Trail Longo de 34,4 km (+1.590m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s 08:30, o <strong>Trail Sprint de 18,9 km (+670m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s 10:00 (Charquinho das Mo\u00e7as &#8211; Covoada), o <strong>Mini-Trail de 10 km<\/strong> e <strong>Caminhada de 6,5 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 11:00 (Vigia da Baleia das Feteiras) e o <strong>TdM Kids<\/strong> \u00e0s 11:30, doando 1 \u20ac de cada inscri\u00e7\u00e3o a uma causa solid\u00e1ria.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">19 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 07:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Centro Social e Paroquial Nossa Senhora das Neves, Relva, Ponta Delgada, A\u00e7ores<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">52 km (Ultra), 34 km (Trail), 19 km (Sprint), 10 km (Mini), 6.5 km (Caminhada) e Kids<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label